    "description": "The Investment Portfolio Holdings Retrieval API provides a comprehensive view of the holdings within a specified investment portfolio. This API allows users to access detailed information about various assets held in the portfolio, including stocks, bonds, and other investment vehicles. It is designed for portfolio managers, financial analysts, and investors who need to monitor and analyze their investment positions effectively. By utilizing this API, users can gain insights into the performance and composition of their portfolios, enabling informed decision-making.",
